---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import IndustryCreativeExamples from "../components/IndustryCreativeExamples.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Industries We Work With" description="Lead generation, conversion funnels, follow-up automation and appointment setting for service businesses, education and lead-driven organizations." path="/industries/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">WHO WE HELP</p><h1>Different businesses. Different buying journeys.</h1><p class="lf-lede">Lead generation is never one-size-fits-all. The offer, buying timeline, customer questions and qualification rules should shape the campaign and the follow-up.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Tell us about your industry ↗</a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>OUR FIT</span><strong>Businesses where a serious inquiry or booked conversation creates the opportunity to win a customer.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<section class="lf-editorial-section" aria-label="Where a connected lead journey matters."><div class="container"><div class="lf-editorial-head"><p class="section-kicker">PRACTICAL APPLICATIONS</p><h2>Where a connected lead journey matters.</h2></div><div class="lf-editorial-grid"><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>01 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Home and property services</h3><p>Location-based demand, seasonal campaigns, property-type qualification, site-visit booking and timely responses.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>02 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Beauty and personal care</h3><p>Visual creative, service-specific landing pages, location targeting and appointment booking with clear expectations.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>03 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Education and professional training</h3><p>Search intent, program-fit screening, course details, affordability expectations and inquiry-to-admissions follow-up.</p></article></div><p class="lf-editorial-note">Every example describes a potential service approach, not a claimed client result.</p></div></section>
<section class="lf-editorial-section" aria-label="The same principles, adapted to the buyer."><div class="container"><div class="lf-editorial-head"><p class="section-kicker">MORE LEAD-DRIVEN BUSINESSES</p><h2>The same principles, adapted to the buyer.</h2></div><div class="lf-editorial-grid"><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>01 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Professional services</h3><p>Build trust, clarify the engagement, capture the right context and route the inquiry to a relevant person.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>02 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>B2B service providers</h3><p>Distinguish research interest from a qualified opportunity and support a longer consultative buying cycle.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>03 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Other suitable industries</h3><p>We also consider adjacent services and e-commerce engagements when our capabilities fit the scope and economics.</p></article></div><p class="lf-editorial-note">Industry-specific work is scoped after understanding lead value, compliance requirements, capacity and the client sales process.</p><div class="lf-editorial-actions"><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/our-approach/">See how we work ↗</a><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/work/">Explore selected work ↗</a></div></div></section>

